\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 3.4 IM-07 \'97 Featured-Item Selector Alignment\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 IM-07 must preserve approved P5-R6a through P5-R6d.\
The three presentation roles remain:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls7\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 TIMELY
\f1\b0  \'97 meaningful near-term significance.\
\ls7\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 DURABLE
\f1\b0  \'97 stable, currently useful information.\
\ls7\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 VISUAL
\f1\b0  \'97 preference for an eligible relevant Flyer.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \strokec2 The implementation must maximize distinct role coverage before ordinary within-role tie-breaking.\
A CivicContent record may qualify for multiple roles, but may not occupy two positions within the same featured Topic column.\
If a Flyer qualifies for both TIMELY and VISUAL and another appropriate TIMELY candidate is available, the Flyer should ordinarily occupy VISUAL to preserve distinct-role coverage.\
The selector must retain deterministic missing-role fallback and same-role collision resolution, including the approved distinction among direct-help, contextual, and stewardship temporal signals.\
No new ContentType or persistent featured-content entity is authorized.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

